John S. Hark: Hey dude, what's up?
You: Ahoy John! Do you have any news of anything, suspicious maybe?
John S. Hark: Suspicious? Nah not really. Although I do hear Bob talking a lot in his sleep.
- Talking? About what?
	John S. Hark: Nothing crazy. He mostly just mutters the name of his wife and kids from home. It's really sweet honestly. I think the more he misses them, the less he talks when he's awake. Feel bad for the guy.
- What do you know about Charles?
	John S. Hark: Not much. But he's very articulate. Every night I see him count his keys and other belongings before he sleeps. That guy never loses anything.
=> END